---
const faqs = [
  {
    pregunta: '¿Cómo puedo solicitar el servicio de FIBERPLUS?',
    icono: `<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20.25 8.511c.884.284 1.5 1.128 1.5 2.097v4.286c0 1.136-.847 2.1-1.98 2.193-.34.027-.68.052-1.02.072v3.091l-3-3c-1.181 0-2.35-.013-3.516-.04-1.133-.093-1.98-1.057-1.98-2.193V10.608c0-.96.616-1.813 1.5-2.097m-4.5-2.25h12c1.24 0 2.25 1.01 2.25 2.25v4.5c0 1.24-1.01 2.25-2.25 2.25h-6l-4.5 4.5V12.75A2.25 2.25 0 012.25 10.5v-2.25A2.25 2.25 0 014.5 6h12z"/>`,
    respuesta: 'Puedes solicitar el servicio llamándonos al +51 946 759 827 o escribiéndonos por WhatsApp. También puedes visitarnos en nuestra oficina en Jr. Arequipa 817, Abancay.',
  },
  {
    pregunta: '¿Cuáles son los canales de atención de FIBERPLUS?',
    icono: `<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 01-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 00-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 002.25 4.5v2.25z"/>`,
    respuesta: 'Atendemos por llamadas (+51 946 759 827 / +51 959 888 104), WhatsApp, correo electrónico (fiberplustel@gmail.com) y presencialmente en nuestra oficina de Lunes a Sábado de 8:00 AM a 8:00 PM.',
  },
  {
    pregunta: '¿Cuáles son los medios de pago disponibles?',
    icono: `<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 8.25h19.5M2.25 9h19.5m-16.5 5.25h6m-6 2.25h3m-3.75 3h15a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25V6.75A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 004.5 19.5z"/>`,
    respuesta: 'Aceptamos pagos en efectivo, transferencias bancarias y pagos digitales. Puedes pagar en nuestra oficina o coordinar con nuestros técnicos.',
  },
  {
    pregunta: '¿El Mesh es un repetidor?',
    icono: `<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.288 15.038a5.25 5.25 0 017.424 0M5.106 11.856c3.807-3.808 9.98-3.808 13.788 0M1.924 8.674c5.565-5.565 14.587-5.565 20.152 0M12.53 18.22l-.53.53-.53-.53a.75.75 0 011.06 0z"/>`,
    respuesta: 'No. El equipo Mesh es más avanzado que un repetidor. Crea una red wifi unificada de alta velocidad en todo tu hogar sin pérdida de señal, conectándose directamente a la red de fibra óptica.',
  },
];
---

<section id="ayuda" class="relative bg-white overflow-hidden py-24">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none">
    <div class="absolute -left-10 top-0 w-105 h-full bg-brand-red/5 skew-x-6"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-brand-red/5 translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto px-8">
    <div class="mb-16">
      <p class="font-body text-brand-red font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Soporte & FAQ</p>
      <h2 class="font-display font-black text-brand-dark text-4xl md:text-6xl uppercase leading-none">
        ¿En qué podemos<br/>
        <span class="text-brand-red">ayudarte</span> hoy?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-brand-dark/50 font-body mt-5 max-w-lg text-base leading-relaxed">
        Encuentra respuestas rápidas o contacta directamente con nuestro equipo de expertos técnicos.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start">
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-3">
        {faqs.map((f, i) => (
          <details class="group border-b border-brand-dark/10 last:border-0">
            <summary class="flex items-center gap-4 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none select-none">
              <span class="font-display font-black text-brand-red/20 text-3xl leading-none w-8 shrink-0 group-open:text-brand-red transition-colors duration-200">
                {String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
              </span>
              <p class="font-display font-bold text-brand-dark text-base md:text-lg flex-1 group-open:text-brand-red transition-colors duration-200">
                {f.pregunta}
              </p>
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-brand-dark/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-open:bg-brand-red group-open:border-brand-red transition-all duration-200">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-dark/40 group-open:text-white group-open:rotate-180 transition-all duration-200" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </summary>
            <div class="pl-12 pb-5">
              <p class="text-brand-dark/55 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed">{f.respuesta}</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 sticky top-8">
        <div class="bg-brand-dark rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col gap-6">

          <div>
            <p class="font-body text-white/40 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">¿No encontraste tu respuesta?</p>
            <p class="font-display font-black text-white text-2xl uppercase leading-tight">
              Habla con un<br/><span class="text-brand-red">experto ahora</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400 animate-pulse shrink-0"></div>
            <p class="text-white/60 font-body text-xs">Lun–Sáb · 8:00 AM – 8:00 PM</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/51946759827"
            target="_blank"
            class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#1ebe5c] text-white font-display font-bold text-base px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-[1.02] shadow-lg shadow-green-900/20"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/>
            </svg>
            Escríbenos por WhatsApp
          </a>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            <a href="tel:+51946759827" class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/70 hover:text-white font-body text-sm transition-colors duration-150 group/tel">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-white/8 flex items-center justify-center group-hover/tel:bg-brand-red/20 transition-colors">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 8V5z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              +51 946 759 827
            </a>
            <a href="tel:+51959888104" class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/70 hover:text-white font-body text-sm transition-colors duration-150 group/tel2">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-white/8 flex items-center justify-center group-hover/tel2:bg-brand-red/20 transition-colors">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 8V5z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              +51 959 888 104
            </a>
            <a href="mailto:fiberplustel@gmail.com" class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/70 hover:text-white font-body text-sm transition-colors duration-150 group/mail">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-white/8 flex items-center justify-center group-hover/mail:bg-brand-red/20 transition-colors">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07-1.916V6.75"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              fiberplustel@gmail.com
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>